#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:372
msgid ""
"<p>Some of the images could not be analyzed with the current settings or "
"they do not contain any red-eyes at all.</p><p><b>Would you like to remove "
"those images from the list?</b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>En Reeg Biller laat sik mit de aktuellen Instellen nich bekieken, oder se "
"bargt gor keen root Ogen.</p><p><b>Wullt Du disse Biller vun de List "
"wegmaken?</b></p>"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:378
msgid "Remove unprocessed images?"
msgstr "Nich afarbeidt Biller wegmaken?"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:404
msgid ""
"<p>You tried to add <b>RAW images</b> to the plugin,<br/>but those filetypes "
"are not supported.</p><p><b>They were automatically removed from the list.</"
"b></p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Du wullt <b>Rohbiller</b> na't Moduul övergeven,<br/> man dat gifft keen "
"Ünnerstütten för disse Dateitypen.</p><p><b>Se wöörn automaatsch vun de List "
"wegmaakt.</b></p>"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:408
msgid "RAW images found"
msgstr "Rohbiller funnen"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:501
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>%1 images have been successfully processed.</p><h2>Correction Complete!</"
"h2>"
msgstr "<p>%1 Biller wöörn mit Spood afarbeidt.</p><h2>Richten afslaten!</h2>"

#: removeredeyeswindow.cpp:505
msgid "Correction Complete"
msgstr "Richten afslaten"

#: settingstab.cpp:165
msgid "Advanced Mode"
msgstr "Verwiedert Bedrief"

#: settingstab.cpp:171
msgid "Simple Mode"
msgstr "Eenfach Bedrief"

#: simplesettings.cpp:86
msgid ""
"<p><b>Slow<br/>(low-res / slightly blurred images)</b></p><p>In this mode "
"the automatic detection and correction of the red eyes is the most reliable. "
"The drawback of the higher detection rate is a much slower computation.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Langsam<br/>(Siet Oplösen / en beten verwischt Biller)</b></p><p> In "
"disse Bedriefoort funkscheneert dat automaatsche Finnen un Richten vun root "
"Ogen op't Best. Man allens hett sien Pries: Dat Utreken bruukt so sien Tiet."
"</p>"

#: simplesettings.cpp:91
msgid ""
"<p><b>Standard</b></p><p>This mode is adequate for most image resolutions. "
"Always try this mode first.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Standard</b></p><p>Disse Bedriefoort passt to de mehrsten Bildoplösen. "
"Probeer ehr jümmers toeerst ut.</p>"

#: simplesettings.cpp:95
msgid ""
"<p><b>Fast<br/>(high-res images)</b></p><p>In this mode the automatic "
"detection will be faster, but more false positives may occur. Use this mode "
"only for very high-resolution and sharp images.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Gau<br/>(hoge Oplösen)</b></p><p>In disse Bedriefoort funkscheneert "
"dat Finnen gauer, man dat gifft ok mehr leeg Drepers. Bruuk de Bedriefoort "
"bloots bi scharp Biller mit redig hooch Oplösen.</p>"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:66
msgid "Storage Settings"
msgstr "Instellen för't Sekern"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:71
msgid "Enter the name of the subfolder here."
msgstr "Hier bitte den Naam vun den Ünnerorner ingeven"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:73
msgid "Save files in a subfolder"
msgstr "Dateien binnen en Ünnerorner sekern"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:74
msgid ""
"If checked, the corrected files will be saved in a subfolder under the "
"current image album path."
msgstr ""
"Is dit anmaakt, warrt de afarbeidt Dateien binnen en Ünnerorner vun't "
"aktuelle Bildalbum sekert."

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:78
msgid "Append string to files"
msgstr "Tekenkeed na Dateien anhangen"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:79
msgid "If checked, a custom string will be added to the corrected file."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt afarbeidt Dateien de angeven Tekenkeed anföögt."

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:82
msgid "Overwrite original files"
msgstr "Orginaaldateien överschrieven"

#: storagesettingsbox.cpp:83
msgid "If checked, all original images will be replaced."
msgstr "Wenn anmaakt, warrt all Orginaaldateien utwesselt."

